<statement>
<p>
	Fill the completed polygon with a transparent color. To get a transparent color you can use the &lt;pf&gt;&#x27;FaceAlpha&#x27;&lt;/pf&gt; parameter of the &lt;pf&gt;fill&lt;/pf&gt; command. Approximate the area using a Monte Carlo simulation Find the exact area using the &lt;pf&gt;polyarea&lt;/pf&gt; command Display both the approximation and the exact area in the upper left corner of the figure.
</p>

